midwire-web-ui (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Updates tab: shows installed and available versions of Midwire's
    packages, checks for updates and installs them, with live progress.
    The work is done by the updater in the midwire-base package.
  * Auto-start: a device that has a network interface is started once it
    has been started from the page before. Previously it was always
    skipped, without saying so.
  * Auto-start: say on the Proxy page why an arriving device was not
    started, and log the decision.
  * Auto-start: notice a device that is pulled and pushed back in within
    a second.
  * Only warn that proxying a device cuts off the page when the page is
    in fact reached through that device. Ignore interfaces that are down.

 -- Sidhant Goel <sidhant@hexcod.in>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:30:00 +0000

midwire-web-ui (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: device list, start and stop with per-device options,
    live log, captures, saved settings with auto-start, Wi-Fi hotspot and
    client settings, admin login.

